<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 0, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 76, background: '#1E4FA8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>2R 正运动学：两段向量首尾相接</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#CFE0F5' }}>M3 · 核心概念</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 12 }} />
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 682, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E8EFF8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <svg width={650} height={432} viewBox='0 0 650 432'>
                <line x1='60' y1='320' x2='520' y2='320' stroke='#3D7BD9' strokeWidth='2' />
                <line x1='90' y1='380' x2='90' y2='24' stroke='#3D7BD9' strokeWidth='2' />
                <line x1='90' y1='320' x2='287.2' y2='40.7' stroke='#8FB6E8' strokeWidth='2' strokeDasharray='7 6' />
                <line x1='271.9' y1='215.0' x2='361.0' y2='163.5' stroke='#8FB6E8' strokeWidth='2' strokeDasharray='6 5' />
                <line x1='90' y1='320' x2='271.9' y2='215.0' stroke='#1E4FA8' strokeWidth='8' strokeLinecap='round' />
                <line x1='271.9' y1='215.0' x2='287.2' y2='40.7' stroke='#0E3F8C' strokeWidth='8' strokeLinecap='round' />
                <polygon points='287.2,40.7 296.0,64.5 278.0,62.5' fill='#0E3F8C' />
                <path d='M 150 320 A 60 60 0 0 0 141.9 290.0' fill='none' stroke='#0E3F8C' strokeWidth='2.5' />
                <path d='M 326.6 201.0 A 60 60 0 0 0 277.0 187.0' fill='none' stroke='#D9534F' strokeWidth='2.5' />
                <circle cx='90' cy='320' r='9' fill='#1E4FA8' />
                <circle cx='271.9' cy='215.0' r='9' fill='#1E4FA8' />
                <circle cx='287.2' cy='40.7' r='10' fill='#0E3F8C' />
                <text x='156' y='312' fill='#0E3F8C' fontSize='19' fontFamily='Times New Roman'>θ₁</text>
                <text x='330' y='196' fill='#D9534F' fontSize='19' fontFamily='Times New Roman'>θ₂</text>
                <text x='166' y='256' fill='#1E4FA8' fontSize='17' fontFamily='Times New Roman'>L₁</text>
                <text x='300' y='146' fill='#0E3F8C' fontSize='17' fontFamily='Times New Roman'>L₂</text>
                <text x='196' y='120' fill='#3D7BD9' fontSize='16' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>合向量</text>
                <text x='300' y='52' fill='#0E3F8C' fontSize='15' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>末端 (x, y)</text>
                <text x='104' y='344' fill='#1A2230' fontSize='14' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei' opacity='0.6'>原点</text>
                <text x='216' y='240' fill='#1A2230' fontSize='14' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei' opacity='0.6'>关节 2</text>
                <text x='510' y='326' fill='#3D7BD9' fontSize='16' fontFamily='Times New Roman'>x</text>
                <text x='96' y='24' fill='#3D7BD9' fontSize='16' fontFamily='Times New Roman'>y</text>
                <text x='325' y='414' textAnchor='middle' fill='#1A2230' fontSize='14' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei' opacity='0.65'>虚线 = 两段向量之和，也就是末端的真实位置</text>
            </svg>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ background: '#E8EFF8', padding: 20, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>第一段的末端，就是第二段的起点</Text>
                <Math latex='x = L_{1}\cos\theta_{1} + L_{2}\cos(\theta_{1}+\theta_{2})' width={420} color='#0E3F8C' />
                <Math latex='y = L_{1}\sin\theta_{1} + L_{2}\sin(\theta_{1}+\theta_{2})' width={420} color='#0E3F8C' />
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E8EFF8', padding: 20, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F' }}>唯一的易错点</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', opacity: 0.8, lineHeight: 1.8 }}>第二段里写的是 <span style={{ fontFamily: 'Times New Roman', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>cos(θ₁+θ₂)</span>，<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>不是</span> cos(θ₂)。</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', opacity: 0.8, lineHeight: 1.8 }}>写错这一个括号，整个末端位置就全错了。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ background: '#0E3F8C', padding: 20, display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>角度累加 = 复合旋转 —— 这就是后面“变换链”思想的雏形。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 44, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1A2230', opacity: 0.5 }}>第 3 章 · M3　平面正运动学：1R → 2R → 3R</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', fontFamily: 'Times New Roman' }}>15 / 21</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
